<title>UK: BSM H1 pretax profit rises 20 percent.</title>
<headline>BSM H1 pretax profit rises 20 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 28</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.50		   vs 6.30</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.53		   vs 2.30</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.92		   vs 2.43</p>
<p> Turnover		   13.78		  vs 11.92</p>
<p> Interest		   0.03 payable	 vs 0.02 payable</p>
<p> Tax			  0.80		   vs 0.63</p>
<p> Net taxed		  2.12		   vs 1.80</p>
<p> Retained profit	  1.37		   vs 1.12</p>
<p> Pay date		   October 28</p>
<p> Div registration date  October 8</p>
<p> Ex-div date		September 30</p>
<p>NOTE - BSM Group Plc provides driving instruction services for the learner driver market.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
